![Croquade](cover.jpg)

For the [Nekki.cl](http://nekki.cl) consultancy: website creation
with shopping cart and payment system integration for Croquade
Chile.

## Technologies

- Prestashop
- PHP
- MySQL
- Webpay KCC 6

In this project a plugin for Prestashop 1.6.x (1.5.x may work too)
was developed, integrating with Transbank's Webpay KCC 6.x online
payment method.

To learn how to configure Webpay on the server, see the Webpay
Guide.

Support for Webpay KCC TR_NORMAL mode.

```github
NinjasCL-archive/prestashop-webpay | Módulo de Webpay KCC para Prestashop
```
